          "title": "You'll want to know: مزیت",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مزیت (maziyat) — \"an advantage, a merit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مزیت این کار این است که نزدیک خانه است. maziyat-e in kâr in ast ke nazdik-e khâne ast. The advantage of this job is that it is near home."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its Arabic broken plural mazâyâ also means benefits at work."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مزیت (maziyat) is usually traced to Arabic maziyya \"merit, distinction\", the quality that sets one thing above another."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
