          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ارزش داشتن (arzesh dâshtan) is native Persian, built from arzesh \"value\", itself built on arz-, the present stem of arzidan \"to be worth\", and dâshtan \"to have\", the inherited verb."
            }
