              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تلاش او بالاخره نتیجه داد. talâsh-e u bâlâkhare natije dâd. Her effort finally paid off."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Natije \"result\" + dâdan \"to give\" (stem deh-): literally to give a result."
            }
